ible team of people  i mean tom was the best partner i could  have ever asked for and the brothers  were  incredible leaders and they made sure to  keep things  to create a safe environment that  allowed us to go to the places that we  really needed to go to which  could be very dark and really really  scary but i knew that  i'd have a partner next to me that  understood where i was going and  you know that he was going to be there  right by my side to catch me if i fell  and that the brothers were going to make  sure we were  staying safe and most importantly sane  during the shooting of this movie and  and were you able  to both stay well within these  characters  and sane or was it really affecting you  guys mentally  i mean listen like it's almost  impossible to go to the places that you  have to go to  in this movie and stay fully sane like  of course it's gonna happen  i don't speak for me personally of  course it's gonna have some effect on  you like i'd be lying if i said i didn't  cry in my trailer  at least once while shooting this movie  it was totally necessary and  and i was willing to go there and i  would do it again in a heartbeat  um what's important is i feel  healthy and happy now um so that's good  sometimes i feel like i've already seen  everything that's gonna happen  and it's a nightmare  you
 

